<tr style="border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7"><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)" id="item.total-score" class="hierarchy"><img src="tbl_spacer.png" alt="." style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="tbl_vjoin_end.png" alt="." style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="icon-q-decimal.png" alt="." style="background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit" title="decimal" class="hierarchy"/> total-score</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy">Total score [NDI]</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy">0..1</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy"><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-decimal">decimal</a></td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy"><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaire-definitions.html#Questionnaire.item.readOnly" title="Is Read Only"><img src="icon-qi-readonly.png" alt="icon"/></a><img src="icon-qi-readonly.png" alt="icon"/></td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy"/></tr>
<tr><td colspan="6" class="hierarchy"><br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table" title="Legend for this format"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="doco" style="background-color: inherit"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name="opt-item.ndi-1"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-1 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25853-5 (&quot;I have no pain at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25854-3 (&quot;The pain is very mild at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25855-0 (&quot;The pain is moderate at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25856-8 (&quot;The pain is fairly severe at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25857-6 (&quot;The pain is very severe at the moment.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25858-4 (&quot;The pain is the worst imaginable at the moment.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-2"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-2 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25859-2 (&quot;I can look after myself normally without causing extra pain.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25860-0 (&quot;I can look after myself normally but it causes extra pain.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25861-8 (&quot;It is painful to look after myself and I am slow and careful.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25862-6 (&quot;I need some help but can manage most of my personal care.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25863-4 (&quot;I need help every day in most aspects of self-care.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25864-2 (&quot;I do not get dressed, I wash with difficulty and stay in bed.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-3"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-3 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25865-9 (&quot;I can lift heavy weights without extra pain.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25866-7 (&quot;I can lift heavy weights but it gives extra pain.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25867-5 (&quot;Pain prevents me lifting heavy weights off the floor, but I can manage if they are conveniently placed, for example on a table.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25868-3 (&quot;Pain prevents me from lifting heavy weights but I can manage light to medium weights if they are conveniently positioned.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25869-1 (&quot;I can only lift very light weights.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25870-9 (&quot;I cannot lift or carry anything.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-4"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-4 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25871-7 (&quot;I can read as much as I want to with no pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25872-5 (&quot;I can read as much as I want to with slight pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25873-3 (&quot;I can read as much as I want with moderate pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25874-1 (&quot;I can't read as much as I want because of moderate pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25875-8 (&quot;I can hardly read at all because of severe pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25876-6 (&quot;I can't read at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-5"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-5 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25877-4 (&quot;I have no headaches at all.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA26365-9 (&quot;I have slight headaches, which come infrequently.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA26366-7 (&quot;I have moderate headaches, which come infrequently.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA26367-5 (&quot;I have moderate headaches, which come frequently.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA26368-3 (&quot;I have severe headaches, which come frequently.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA26369-1 (&quot;I have headaches almost all the time.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-6"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-6 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25878-2 (&quot;I can concentrate fully when I want to with no difficulty.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25879-0 (&quot;I can concentrate fully when I want to with slight difficulty.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25880-8 (&quot;I have a fair degree of difficulty in concentrating when I want to.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25881-6 (&quot;I have a lot of difficulty in concentrating when I want to.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25882-4 (&quot;I have a great deal of difficulty in concentrating when I want to.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25883-2 (&quot;I can't concentrate at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-7"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-7 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25884-0 (&quot;I can do as much work as I want to.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25885-7 (&quot;I can only do my usual work, but no more.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25886-5 (&quot;I can do most of my usual work, but no more.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25887-3 (&quot;I cannot do my usual work.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25888-1 (&quot;I can hardly do any work at all.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25889-9 (&quot;I can't do any work at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-8"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-8 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25890-7 (&quot;I can drive my car without any neck pain.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25891-5 (&quot;I can drive my car as long as I want with slight pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25892-3 (&quot;I can drive my car as long as I want with moderate pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25893-1 (&quot;I can't drive my car as long as I want because of moderate pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25894-9 (&quot;I can hardly drive at all because of severe pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25895-6 (&quot;I can't drive my car at all.&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-9"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-9 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25896-4 (&quot;I have no trouble sleeping.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25897-2 (&quot;My sleep is slightly disturbed (less than 1 hr sleepless).&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25898-0 (&quot;My sleep is mildly disturbed (1-2 hrs sleepless).&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25899-8 (&quot;My sleep is moderately disturbed (2-3 hrs sleepless).&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25900-4 (&quot;My sleep is greatly disturbed (3-5 hrs sleepless).&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25901-2 (&quot;My sleep is completely disturbed (5-7 hrs sleepless).&quot;)</li></ul><a name="opt-item.ndi-10"> </a><p><b>Answer options for ndi-10 </b></p><ul><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25902-0 (&quot;I am able to engage in all my recreation activities with no neck pain at all.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25903-8 (&quot;I am able to engage in all my recreation activities, with some pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25904-6 (&quot;I am able to engage in most, but not all of my usual recreation activities because of pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25905-3 (&quot;I am able to engage in a few of my usual recreation activities because of pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25906-1 (&quot;I can hardly do any recreation activities because of pain in my neck.&quot;)</li><li style="font-size: 11px">http://loinc.org#LA25907-9 (&quot;I can't do any recreation activities due at all.&quot;)</li></ul></div>
